OL,3,GNEWSAGardai allowed cars to be taken
OL,4,Ainto NI for terrorist activity, Omagh
OL,5,Ainquiry hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn Garda Siochana (Irish police)
OL,8,Fallowed cars to be taken into Northern
OL,9,FIreland for terrorist activity, the
OL,10,FOmagh Bombing Inquiry has heard.
OL,12,FIt came as Martin Bridger who worked as
OL,13,Fan officer for the Police Ombudsman
OL,14,FNorthern Ireland (PONI) gave evidence.
OL,16,FHe said that a Garda whistleblower told
OL,17,Fhim that a senior Garda officer allowed
OL,18,Fstolen cars to cross into Northern
OL,19,FIreland to gather intelligence.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
