OL,3,GNEWSAGardai allowed cars to be taken
OL,4,Ainto NI for terrorist activity, Omagh
OL,5,Ainquiry hears
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwenty-nine people - including a woman
OL,8,Fpregnant with twins - died in the bomb
OL,9,Fin the County Tyrone town on 15 August
OL,10,F1998. It was the biggest single
OL,11,Fatrocity in the Troubles.
